{"scene":"<p>The station clock stopped at 00:17. Beneath it, Mara turned the ticket over once, then tucked it beneath her thumb.</p><section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-voice\" data-effect=\"plain\" style=\"--mh-speaker:#e4bd78\"><header class=\"mh-voice-rail\"><span></span><b>Mara</b><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span></span></header><div class=\"mh-utterance\"><span class=\"mh-voice-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-voice-text\">“That train wasn’t here a minute ago.”</span></div><div class=\"mh-voice-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></section><p>The doors opened without a sound. Mara laid the ticket against the timetable, covering an empty line with tomorrow’s date.</p><section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-voice\" data-effect=\"hush\" style=\"--mh-speaker:#c6ace6\"><header class=\"mh-voice-rail\"><span></span><b>Station attendant</b><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span></span></header><div class=\"mh-utterance\"><span class=\"mh-voice-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-voice-text\">“Last service. If you have a ticket.”</span></div><div class=\"mh-voice-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></section>","dock":"<details class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-dock\" open><summary class=\"mh-mast\"><span class=\"mh-brand\"><span class=\"mh-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><b>✦</b></span><span><strong>BLACKBOX</strong><span class=\"mh-meta\">EiDOS / NEURAL DOCK</span></span></span><span class=\"mh-session\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">SESSION / <span>8</span></span><span class=\"mh-dock-label\"><span class=\"mh-collapse\">COLLAPSE</span><span class=\"mh-expand\">EXPAND</span><i class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span></span></summary><div class=\"mh-dock-content\"><div class=\"mh-dock-tools\"><details class=\"mh-motion\" open><summary aria-label=\"Toggle interface motion\"><span class=\"mh-live\">MOTION ON</span><span class=\"mh-still\">MOTION OFF</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary></details></div><div class=\"mh-dock-grid\"><!--BB_DOCK_BEGIN-->\n<details class=\"mh-module mh-fork\"><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">↗</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Fork protocol</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><div class=\"mh-fork-note\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">FIVE ROUTES / CONSEQUENCES ARE POSSIBILITIES</span></div><div class=\"mh-choices\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-choice mh-fork-choice\" data-regex-action=\"blackbox-fork-1\"><span class=\"mh-choice-key\">01</span><span class=\"mh-choice-content\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">GROUND</span><span class=\"mh-choice-action\">Examine the ticket under the platform light.</span><span class=\"mh-choice-hint\">Test a detail before committing to the journey.</span></span><span class=\"mh-choice-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-choice mh-fork-choice\" data-regex-action=\"blackbox-fork-2\"><span class=\"mh-choice-key\">02</span><span class=\"mh-choice-content\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">INTERRUPT</span><span class=\"mh-choice-action\">Ask Mara why she recognizes the train.</span><span class=\"mh-choice-hint\">Invite disclosure; she may choose to withhold it.</span></span><span class=\"mh-choice-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-choice mh-fork-choice\" data-regex-action=\"blackbox-fork-3\"><span class=\"mh-choice-key\">03</span><span class=\"mh-choice-content\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">WAGER</span><span class=\"mh-choice-action\">Board and keep the door in sight.</span><span class=\"mh-choice-hint\">Gain access while accepting an uncertain exit.</span></span><span class=\"mh-choice-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-choice mh-fork-choice\" data-regex-action=\"blackbox-fork-4\"><span class=\"mh-choice-key\">04</span><span class=\"mh-choice-content\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">REFRAME</span><span class=\"mh-choice-action\">Speak to the station attendant.</span><span class=\"mh-choice-hint\">Seek an independent account of the arrival.</span></span><span class=\"mh-choice-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mh-choice mh-fork-choice\" data-regex-action=\"blackbox-fork-5\"><span class=\"mh-choice-key\">05</span><span class=\"mh-choice-content\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">DIVERGE</span><span class=\"mh-choice-action\">Stay on the platform and watch.</span><span class=\"mh-choice-hint\">Preserve distance; the departure window may close.</span></span><span class=\"mh-choice-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></details>\n<details class=\"mh-module mh-core\" open><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Core presence</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><div class=\"mh-core-layout\"><figure class=\"mh-portrait\"><div class=\"mh-reticle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><img data-bb-image=\"ui\" src=\"assets/eidos.webp\" alt=\"EiDOS, a blue feline interface suspended from mechanical cables\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"><figcaption>UNIT / 01 <span>↗</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"mh-core-copy\"><span class=\"mh-meta\"><span class=\"mh-led\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> CORE PRESENCE</span><h2>EiDOS<span>®</span></h2><div class=\"mh-copy\">She recognizes the train, but not the destination. Notice what she protects before deciding what her silence means.</div><div class=\"mh-core-tail\"><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"mh-meta\">OBSERVATION ≠ CANON</span></div></div></div></div></details>\n<details class=\"mh-module mh-parasite\" open><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">×</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Parasite feed</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><div class=\"mh-parasite-layout\"><figure class=\"mh-kazz-cutout\"><img data-bb-image=\"ui\" src=\"assets/kazz.webp\" width=\"480\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Kazz lounging on his mechanical centipede\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"mh-parasite-copy\"><header><h3>@KAZZ</h3><span class=\"mh-infected\">✦ FOREIGN PROCESS</span></header><div class=\"mh-copy\">Oh, a train that isn't on the timetable. Excellent. Completely normal. Ask about the ticket before you adopt a new supernatural problem.</div><div class=\"mh-parasite-sign\">PARASITE FEED / NONCANONICAL</div></div></div></div></details>\n<details class=\"mh-module mh-affect\" open><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">◇</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Conductance</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><div class=\"mh-meter\" style=\"--aff:+23\"><div class=\"mh-meter-top\"><span class=\"mh-meta\">AFFINITY</span><span class=\"mh-delta\">Δ +2%</span></div><div class=\"mh-meter-number\">+23<small>%</small><span class=\"mh-meter-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✧</span></div><div class=\"mh-range\"><i></i></div><div class=\"mh-scale\"><span>−100</span><span>0</span><span>+100</span></div><div class=\"mh-stats\"><span>SPARKS <b>3</b></span><span>GRUDGE <b>0</b></span><span class=\"gh-stat-chip\">TAKE <b>8</b></span></div><div class=\"mh-meter-note\">Shared curiosity builds trust; Mara keeps the ticket within reach.</div></div></div></details>\n\n<details class=\"mh-module mh-archive-module\"><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">⊕</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Deep archive</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><section class=\"mh-archive\"><header class=\"mh-archive-head\"><span class=\"mh-archive-emblem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mh-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><b>✦</b></span></span><div><span class=\"mh-meta\">CONTINUITY ENGINE</span><h2>Deep<br>Archive<span>®</span></h2></div><div class=\"mh-snapshot\">SNAPSHOT — TAKE 08</div></header><div class=\"mh-archive-grid\">\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"1\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M7 5h10M6 10h12M7 15h10M9 20h6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>Causal spine</strong><small>Events / objectives / knowledge</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">01</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>The unlisted train</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Record</span><span>An empty train arrived at 00:17. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Access</span><span>Both investigators saw it. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Unknown</span><span>Its origin.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>The ticket</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Record</span><span>A paper ticket bears tomorrow's date. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Access</span><span>Mara read it aloud. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Condition</span><span>Kept as evidence.</span></div></div></div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"5\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 5l8 7 8-7M4 19l8-7 8 7M4 5v14M20 5v14\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>Relationship mesh</strong><small>Independent pressures</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">05</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Mara ↔ Operator</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Attachment</span><span>Trust is growing. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Friction</span><span>Mara wants to board; the operator has not decided. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Unknown</span><span>Whether they will travel together.</span></div></div></div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"8\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7h18M3 17h18M7 3v18M17 3v18\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>World-body</strong><small>Positions / constraints / hazards</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">08</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Spatial</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\">Platform 04, under the last working lamp. The train doors remain open.</div></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Hazards</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\">The timetable is unreliable. No immediate physical threat is established.</div></div>\n</details>\n</div><footer class=\"mh-foot\"><span>RETAINED CONTEXT</span><span>THE SYSTEM REMEMBERS</span></footer></section></div></details>\n\n<!--BB_DOCK_END--></div><footer class=\"mh-foot\"><span>WIRED ORGANISM</span><span>DO NOT DISCONNECT WHILE DREAMING ✦</span></footer></div></details>","archive":"<section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-archive-shell\"><details class=\"mh-module mh-archive-module\"><summary><span class=\"mh-key\">⊕</span><span class=\"mh-module-title\">Deep archive</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"mh-module-body\"><section class=\"mh-archive\"><header class=\"mh-archive-head\"><span class=\"mh-archive-emblem\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mh-orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><b>✦</b></span></span><div><span class=\"mh-meta\">CONTINUITY ENGINE</span><h2>Deep<br>Archive<span>®</span></h2></div><div class=\"mh-snapshot\">SNAPSHOT — TAKE 08</div></header><div class=\"mh-archive-grid\">\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"1\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M7 5h10M6 10h12M7 15h10M9 20h6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>Causal spine</strong><small>Events / objectives / knowledge</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">01</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>The unlisted train</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Record</span><span>An empty train arrived at 00:17. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Access</span><span>Both investigators saw it. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Unknown</span><span>Its origin.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>The ticket</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Record</span><span>A paper ticket bears tomorrow's date. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Access</span><span>Mara read it aloud. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Condition</span><span>Kept as evidence.</span></div></div></div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"5\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 5l8 7 8-7M4 19l8-7 8 7M4 5v14M20 5v14\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>Relationship mesh</strong><small>Independent pressures</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">05</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Mara ↔ Operator</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\"><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Attachment</span><span>Trust is growing. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Friction</span><span>Mara wants to board; the operator has not decided. </span></div><div class=\"mh-field\"><span>Unknown</span><span>Whether they will travel together.</span></div></div></div>\n</details>\n<details class=\"mh-circuit\" data-circuit=\"8\"><summary><span class=\"mh-circuit-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"display:inline-block;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;color:inherit;vertical-align:middle\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7h18M3 17h18M7 3v18M17 3v18\"/></svg></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-label\"><strong>World-body</strong><small>Positions / constraints / hazards</small></span><span class=\"mh-circuit-index\">08</span><span class=\"mh-plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Spatial</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\">Platform 04, under the last working lamp. The train doors remain open.</div></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record\"><div class=\"bb-atlas-name\"><b>Hazards</b></div><div class=\"bb-atlas-record-body\">The timetable is unreliable. No immediate physical threat is established.</div></div>\n</details>\n</div><footer class=\"mh-foot\"><span>RETAINED CONTEXT</span><span>THE SYSTEM REMEMBERS</span></footer></section></div></details></section>","voices":"<section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-voice\" data-effect=\"plain\" style=\"--mh-speaker:#e4bd78\"><header class=\"mh-voice-rail\"><span></span><b>Mara</b><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span></span></header><div class=\"mh-utterance\"><span class=\"mh-voice-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-voice-text\">“You don’t have to trust me. Look at the date.”</span></div><div class=\"mh-voice-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></section><section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-voice\" data-effect=\"hush\" style=\"--mh-speaker:#c6ace6\"><header class=\"mh-voice-rail\"><span></span><b>Station attendant</b><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span></span></header><div class=\"mh-utterance\"><span class=\"mh-voice-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-voice-text\">“Some journeys arrive before they leave.”</span></div><div class=\"mh-voice-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></section><section class=\"bb44 bb44-dark mh-voice\" data-effect=\"tremor\" style=\"--mh-speaker:#e995a4\"><header class=\"mh-voice-rail\"><span></span><b>Someone</b><span class=\"mh-wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span></span></header><div class=\"mh-utterance\"><span class=\"mh-voice-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"mh-voice-text\">“Wait. That’s my name on your ticket.”</span></div><div class=\"mh-voice-end\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></section>"}